{"3375990": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "PC Cafe Simulator", "steam_appid": 3375990, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build, run, and grow your very own PC cafe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PC Cafe Simulator is a management simulation game set in a Korean PC cafe. Become the owner of a PC cafe and grow it from a small shop into a popular place filled with customers. Play solo at your own pace, or team up with friends in co-op multiplayer for up to 8 players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🖥️ Build Your Own PC Cafe</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375990/extras/d39d43fcd50f29225e7ff224167d73ad.poster.avif?t=1782137218\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375990/extras/d39d43fcd50f29225e7ff224167d73ad.webm?t=1782137218\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375990/extras/d39d43fcd50f29225e7ff224167d73ad.mp4?t=1782137218\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase the furniture and equipment you need to run your PC cafe and decorate it your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375990/extras/4bfe314d49ae3b7a0b9d05b904b81aef.poster.avif?t=1782137218\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375990/extras/4bfe314d49ae3b7a0b9d05b904b81aef.webm?t=1782137218\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375990/extras/4bfe314d49ae3b7a0b9d05b904b81aef.mp4?t=1782137218\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use customization features to create your own PC cafe atmosphere and interior style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🍜 Cook and Serve a Variety of Food</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375990/extras/5f2d6ee22d81c443a61f41335a111b56.poster.avif?t=1782137218\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375990/extras/5f2d6ee22d81c443a61f41335a111b56.webm?t=1782137218\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375990/extras/5f2d6ee22d81c443a61f41335a111b56.mp4?t=1782137218\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No PC cafe is complete without food!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cook the food your customers order and serve it to them yourself. Keep your customers satisfied with delicious meals and increase your sales.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📦 Order Supplies and Manage Your Store</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375990/extras/22bd888fffdf3d5821e4eb7c943fca59.poster.avif?t=1782137218\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375990/extras/22bd888fffdf3d5821e4eb7c943fca59.webm?t=1782137218\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375990/extras/22bd888fffdf3d5821e4eb7c943fca59.mp4?t=1782137218\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Order the supplies you need for your PC cafe through the computer and receive deliveries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375990/extras/232e861de756861d8edbcb65060e7d64.poster.avif?t=1782137218\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375990/extras/232e861de756861d8edbcb65060e7d64.webm?t=1782137218\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375990/extras/232e861de756861d8edbcb65060e7d64.mp4?t=1782137218\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage the inventory needed to keep your store running. Efficient management is the key to success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🚶 Realistic Customers and Staff</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375990/extras/dfef219670ff1386c2a19431617e4ca6.poster.avif?t=1782137218\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375990/extras/dfef219670ff1386c2a19431617e4ca6.webm?t=1782137218\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375990/extras/dfef219670ff1386c2a19431617e4ca6.mp4?t=1782137218\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customers will visit your PC cafe, sit down, play games, order food, and leave reviews.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375990/extras/32c1b9c6a93700d106c1b2505592f64e.poster.avif?t=1782137218\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375990/extras/32c1b9c6a93700d106c1b2505592f64e.webm?t=1782137218\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375990/extras/32c1b9c6a93700d106c1b2505592f64e.mp4?t=1782137218\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If there are no customers, head outside and attract passersby to bring more people into your PC cafe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌦️ Rain or Shine</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375990/extras/0001ecebdee8fe74fd0f8dc2a49afef3.poster.avif?t=1782137218\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375990/extras/0001ecebdee8fe74fd0f8dc2a49afef3.webm?t=1782137218\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375990/extras/0001ecebdee8fe74fd0f8dc2a49afef3.mp4?t=1782137218\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The sun rises and sets as time passes, and the weather system changes the atmosphere from day to day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧹 Deal With Troublemakers Yourself</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375990/extras/56d99d1ae91f270cef94dad7f971a70f.poster.avif?t=1782137218\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375990/extras/56d99d1ae91f270cef94dad7f971a70f.webm?t=1782137218\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375990/extras/56d99d1ae91f270cef94dad7f971a70f.mp4?t=1782137218\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some customers may run away without paying or cause a scene. Deal with them yourself using a broom!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >👥 Play Alone or With Friends</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375990/extras/fb34bfec5f2ef1319bcfb3b51e94a68b.poster.avif?t=1782137218\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375990/extras/fb34bfec5f2ef1319bcfb3b51e94a68b.webm?t=1782137218\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375990/extras/fb34bfec5f2ef1319bcfb3b51e94a68b.mp4?t=1782137218\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run your PC cafe at your own pace in single-player, or split up roles with friends in co-op multiplayer for up to 8 players and manage the store more efficiently.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375990/extras/0b11453a4bd90e5dd13a785429d77b74.poster.avif?t=1782137218\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375990/extras/0b11453a4bd90e5dd13a785429d77b74.webm?t=1782137218\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375990/extras/0b11453a4bd90e5dd13a785429d77b74.mp4?t=1782137218\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you need a break, relax by listening to music or watching videos. Of course, you can enjoy them together with your friends too!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375990/extras/34b04afdea4788cc9290b742c37e06f7.poster.avif?t=1782137218\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375990/extras/34b04afdea4788cc9290b742c37e06f7.webm?t=1782137218\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375990/extras/34b04afdea4788cc9290b742c37e06f7.mp4?t=1782137218\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If one of your lazy friends is not doing their job, teach them a lesson with your broom!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build, run, and grow your very own PC cafe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PC Cafe Simulator is a management simulation game set in a Korean PC cafe. Become the owner of a PC cafe and grow it from a small shop into a popular place filled with customers. Play solo at your own pace, or team up with friends in co-op multiplayer for up to 8 players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🖥️ Build Your Own PC Cafe</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375990/extras/d39d43fcd50f29225e7ff224167d73ad.poster.avif?t=1782137218\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375990/extras/d39d43fcd50f29225e7ff224167d73ad.webm?t=1782137218\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375990/extras/d39d43fcd50f29225e7ff224167d73ad.mp4?