 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375990/extras/dfef219670ff1386c2a19431617e4ca6.webm?t=1782137218\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375990/extras/dfef219670ff1386c2a19431617e4ca6.mp4?t=1782137218\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customers will visit your PC cafe, sit down, play games, order food, and leave reviews.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375990/extras/32c1b9c6a93700d106c1b2505592f64e.poster.avif?t=1782137218\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375990/extras/32c1b9c6a93700d106c1b2505592f64e.webm?t=1782137218\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375990/extras/32c1b9c6a93700d106c1b2505592f64e.mp4?t=1782137218\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If there are no customers, head outside and attract passersby to bring more people into your PC cafe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌦️ Rain or Shine</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375990/extras/0001ecebdee8fe74fd0f8dc2a49afef3.poster.avif?t=1782137218\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375990/extras/0001ecebdee8fe74fd0f8dc2a49afef3.webm?t=1782137218\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375990/extras/0001ecebdee8fe74fd0f8dc2a49afef3.mp4?t=1782137218\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The sun rises and sets as time passes, and the weather system changes the atmosphere from day to day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧹 Deal With Troublemakers Yourself</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375990/extras/56d99d1ae91f270cef94dad7f971a70f.poster.avif?t=1782137218\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375990/extras/56d99d1ae91f270cef94dad7f971a70f.webm?t=1782137218\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375990/extras/56d99d1ae91f270cef94dad7f971a70f.mp4?t=1782137218\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some customers may run away without paying or cause a scene. Deal with them yourself using a broom!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >👥 Play Alone or With Friends</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375990/extras/fb34bfec5f2ef1319bcfb3b51e94a68b.poster.avif?t=1782137218\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375990/extras/fb34bfec5f2ef1319bcfb3b51e94a68b.webm?t=1782137218\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375990/extras/fb34bfec5f2ef1319bcfb3b51e94a68b.mp4?t=1782137218\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run your PC cafe at your own pace in single-player, or split up roles with friends in co-op multiplayer for up to 8 players and manage the store more efficiently.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375990/extras/0b11453a4bd90e5dd13a785429d77b74.poster.avif?t=1782137218\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375990/extras/0b11453a4bd90e5dd13a785429d77b74.webm?t=1782137218\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375990/extras/0b11453a4bd90e5dd13a785429d77b74.mp4?t=1782137218\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you need a break, relax by listening to music or watching videos. Of course, you can enjoy them together with your friends too!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375990/extras/34b04afdea4788cc9290b742c37e06f7.poster.avif?t=1782137218\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375990/extras/34b04afdea4788cc9290b742c37e06f7.webm?t=1782137218\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375990/extras/34b04afdea4788cc9290b742c37e06f7.mp4?t=1782137218\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If one of your lazy friends is not doing their job, teach them a lesson with your broom!</p>", "short_description": "Run your own Korean PC cafe! From customer service to cooking and store management — experience life as a PC cafe owner. Start small, hire staff, expand your store, and deal with troublesome customers yourself! Play solo or co-op with up to 8 players.", "supported_languages": "English, Korean, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Russian, Japanese, Simp